    <decisions>
        <description>This flow is tracking the Duration of each Status on the Global Service Case.
Algo for the flow: 
1) Check if the Status is changed or for newly created Case.
2) For Newly created cases, its updating the Start Date/Time of the Case where Status= New
3) For Status is changed, its updating the Start Date/Time of the Case according to the Current Status.
4) It is checking the Prior Status on the Case and updating the two fields for Status Duration
Field 1: Status Duration (in Seconds); it is calculating the Status duration from the Start Date/Time of the Prior Status. It will also consider the Prior Duration of the Status and add this in the Status Duration.
Field 2: Converting the Status Duration in Days Hours Minutes Seconds and displaying those.

Note: Using the After Flow to update SLA as the Waiting for Agent Status is getting updated after the record is getting saved.</description>
        <name>Global_Service_Case_Updates</name>
        <label>Global Service Case Updates</label>
        <locationX>974</locationX>
        <locationY>335</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Track_Status_Duration</name>
            <conditionLogic>or</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Check_Current_Status</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Track Status Duration</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Newly_Created_Cases</name>
            <conditionLogic>or</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>WasSet</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Check_Current_Status</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
            <label>Newly Created Cases</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Calculate the each Status Duration for Global Service Case. 
For reference, check the user story #14209 on Gitlab</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Calculate the Total Duration in Seconds where Status = Assigned</description>
        <name>Assigned_Duration_InSeconds</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.GSC_Assigned_Duration__c}), VALUE(TEXT( {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime} - {!$Record__Prior.GSC_Assigned_Start_Time__c} ) )*84600,
(VALUE(TEXT( {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime} - {!$Record__Prior.GSC_Assigned_Start_Time__c} ) )*84600) + {!$Record__Prior.GSC_Assigned_Duration__c}
)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
